 screen  the cursor disappears until you touch  the trackpad again not only that but  iPad OS 13.4 gives you the same cursor  support with Apple's Magic Mouse too and  Magic Trackpad too  the only downside is that this new  incredible magic keyboard costs $300 for  either of the 11 inch iPad pro models  now I know that's a lot of money but you  could still use the regular smart  keyboard or any third-party keyboard  with the new iPad pro so you're not  forced to spend that much money and by  the way we have a video comparing the  best smart keyboards currently out there  which you can check out after this video  and there are actually some keyboards  coming soon like the Bridge Pro Plus  which also packs  Trackpad so you can save some cash by  going with that but the new magic  keyboard is honestly better because it  has the new floating iPad hinge in any  case if you're not sure which one to buy  you can just buy the iPad pro right now  and wait a while to get the keyboard and  one last thing Apple's new marketing  video for the new iPad pro on YouTube  sarcastically says that it's not a  computer which I find pretty funny and  ironic because years ago they made a  marketing video that said it was a  computer and it ended up getting a lot  of backlash you can check out Apple's  new video right over there and be sure  to click the circle above to subscribe  so you don't miss out on a hands-on  comparison video against the 2018 iPad  pro thanks for watching and we'll see  you in the next video  [Music]
 

